# hooks/desktop/title.redact — window classes whose TITLE is never forwarded (the bridge sends "title=<class window>").
# Browsers carry bank/account/mail titles. One class or app_id per line, case-insensitive, globs allowed.
# Override: OPENJAWZ_TITLE_REDACT=<file>.
firefox
firefox-*
org.mozilla.firefox
chromium
chromium-browser
org.chromium.Chromium
chrome
google-chrome*
brave
brave-browser
com.brave.Browser
librewolf
zen
zen-*
app.zen_browser.zen
vivaldi*
microsoft-edge*
signal
org.signal.Signal
